CS-WebUI is an independent .NET binding for WebUI.

Bundled native assets are built from webui-dev/webui, Copyright (c) 2020-2026
Hassan Draga and contributors, distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/webui-dev/webui

The complete upstream license is retained in this repository at
eng/licenses/WebUI-LICENSE.txt and in the CsWebUi.Native package under
licenses/WebUI/.

The WebUI and C# logo is the official webui_csharp.png asset published by
webui-dev/webui-logo, Copyright (c) 2023 Hassan Draga, distributed under the
MIT License:
https://github.com/webui-dev/webui-logo

The logo license is retained at eng/licenses/WebUI-Logo-LICENSE.txt and in the
NuGet packages under licenses/WebUI-Logo/.

The exact official upstream nightly revision and archive digests are recorded
in eng/webui-nightly-assets.json. Source-build and lifecycle verification use
that same webui-dev/webui revision pinned in flake.lock. Published Windows and
Linux libraries are the verified official archives selected by the manifest.
Published macOS libraries are built by CS-WebUI CI from that same official
revision with upstream's GNUmakefile release recipe and a macOS 15.0
deployment target, because the official macOS archives require the newest
macOS. Their digests and build run are recorded in the package under
provenance/WebUI/webui-macos-source-build.json.

The optional statically linked Windows build includes WebView2LoaderStatic.lib
from the Microsoft.Web.WebView2 SDK, version 1.0.4078.44. Its license and
third-party notices are included under licenses/WebView2 in the
CsWebUi.Native package.
